# tmp/ holds code-analysis artifacts that should NOT be tracked in git.
# Local-only, regenerable, and ephemeral by nature. Kept on disk so the
# work survives /tmp/ cleanups and so future iterations can find the
# analysis that informed earlier version work.
#
# The README.md (this directory's convention doc) IS tracked.
# Everything else matches `*` and is ignored.

*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
